sequenceDiagram
  participant ESP as ESP32
  participant API as Supabase REST
  participant DB as Database
  participant RT as Realtime
  participant BR as Browser

  ESP->>API: POST /fire_logs JSON
  API->>DB: INSERT row
  DB-->>RT: notify
  RT-->>BR: event INSERT
  BR->>BR: update UI angle relay flame

  BR->>API: PATCH /control wifi_reset
  API->>DB: UPDATE row id=1
  ESP->>API: GET /control wifi_reset
  API->>ESP: json wi-fi-reset flag
